@startuml
' bt-view-kind: container
' bt-view-id: ecosystem-topology:runtime-containers
title Better Tomorrow - Canonical Runtime Containers
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: identity
' bt-element-id: play_proxy
' bt-element-id: authored_truth
' bt-element-id: live_runtime
' bt-element-id: proposal_runtime

rectangle "Identity and Platform\nResponsibility: Authenticate users and serve platform data\nContract: Backend ownership\n[[../../../../backend/app/api/v1/auth_routes.py source]]" as identity
rectangle "Play Proxy\nResponsibility: Bridge player requests to live authority\nContract: No local story commit\n[[../../../../backend/app/services/game/game_service.py source]]" as play_proxy
rectangle "Authored Truth\nResponsibility: Supply experience identity and policy\nContract: Immutable bound module version\n[[../../../../content/modules/god_of_carnage/module.yaml source]]" as authored_truth
rectangle "Live Runtime\nResponsibility: Coordinate and commit canonical turns\nContract: World-engine ownership\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/story_runtime/manager/runtime_manager.py source]]" as live_runtime
rectangle "Proposal Runtime\nResponsibility: Interpret, retrieve, plan, realize and validate candidates\nContract: AI proposal only\n[[../../../../ai_stack/langgraph/langgraph_runtime_executor.py source]]" as proposal_runtime

identity ..> play_proxy : "authorizes launch\ncontract: player and run binding\n[[../../../../backend/app/api/v1/game/player_turn_execution_and_flush.py source]]"
proposal_runtime ..> live_runtime : "returns candidate\ncontract: validation evidence and no commit\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/story_runtime/narrative_commit_resolution.py source]]"
play_proxy ..> live_runtime : "forwards command\ncontract: signed ticket\n[[../../../../backend/app/services/game/game_service.py source]]"
live_runtime ..> proposal_runtime : "requests candidate\ncontract: proposal-only call\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/story_runtime/governed_runtime_adapters.py source]]"
authored_truth ..> live_runtime : "bounds session\ncontract: immutable module version\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/content/backend_loader.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: container
Concern: Identity, proxy, authored truth, live commit and proposal runtime boundaries
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
